# Blog agents module

Read **`guidelines/agent-devlog-blog-agents.md`** before changes.

- **Flag:** `VITE_ENABLE_BLOG_AGENTS` — default off until Phase 4
- **Do not** import agent module into blog detail/list/Mermaid
- **Do not** put OpenRouter keys in client env
- **Writes:** `saveBlog()` only; `agent_*` Firestore collections for sessions/audit
